{"id":"655674","name":"桂花糯米藕","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/655674/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"藕","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买两个短粗胖的藕。","img":"images/655674/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮。","img":"images/655674/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切掉边上，露出孔眼。","img":"images/655674/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把糯米装在瓶子里，倒入藕孔。","img":"images/655674/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"装满。","img":"images/655674/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"抠上边边，用牙签固定。","img":"images/655674/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入电饭锅，水没过藕，放两块红糖。","img":"images/655674/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入一把红枣，剪开去核。","img":"images/655674/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒸煮1个小时。","img":"images/655674/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"就煮软烂了。","img":"images/655674/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切成片。","img":"images/655674/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}